{"speciesId":367,"names":{"fr":"Serpang","es":"Huntail","en":"Huntail","ja":"ハンテール"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"HUNTAIL’s presence went unnoticed by people for a long time because it lives at extreme depths in the sea. This POKéMON’s eyes can see clearly even in the murky dark depths of the ocean."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"HUNTAIL’s tail is shaped like a fish. It uses the tail to attract prey, then swallows the prey whole with its large, gaping mouth. This POKéMON swims by wiggling its slender body like a snake."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"To withstand the crushing pressure of water deep under the sea, its spine is very thick and sturdy. Its tail, which is shaped like a small fish, has eyes that light up."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It lives deep in the sea where no light ever filters down. It lights up its small fishlike tail to attract prey."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It lives deep in the sea where no light ever filters down. It lights up its small fishlike tail to attract prey."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It lives deep in the pitch-dark sea. It attracts prey by moving its tail in mimicry of a small animal."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It lives deep in the pitch-dark sea. It attracts prey by moving its tail in mimicry of a small animal."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il vit loin sous la mer. Il appâte les proies crédules avec sa queue qui rappelle un petit poisson."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il vit loin sous la mer. Il appâte les proies crédules avec sa queue qui rappelle un petit poisson."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il vit dans les abysses, là où la lumière ne va jamais. Il allume le bout de sa queue, qui ressemble à un poisson, pour attirer ses proies."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Vive en los abismos marinos, donde no se filtra la luz. Tiene una cola en forma de pez, que enciende para atraer a su presa."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It lives deep in the sea where no light ever filters down. It lights up its small fishlike tail to attract prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"光の 届かない 深海に 生息。 小魚に 似た 尻尾を 光らせて 獲物を 誘い出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit loin sous la mer. Il appâte les proies crédules avec sa queue qui rappelle un petit poisson."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive en los fondos marinos. Atrae a sus confiadas presas con la cola, que tiene forma de pez."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It lives deep in the sea. With a tail shaped like a small fish, it attracts unsuspecting prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"深海に 生息する ポケモン。 小魚の 形をした 尻尾で 獲物を 誘き寄せ 捕まえる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"L’existence de Serpang fut longtemps ignorée, car il vit dans les profondeurs abyssales des océans. Les yeux de ce Pokémon sont excellents et peuvent même voir à travers les eaux troubles des grandes profondeurs."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Huntail ha pasado desapercibido durante mucho tiempo por vivir en las profundidades del mar. El sentido de la vista de este Pokémon le permite ver en las oscuras y turbias aguas submarinas."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Huntail’s presence went unnoticed by people for a long time because it lives at extreme depths in the sea. This Pokémon’s eyes can see clearly even in the murky dark depths of the ocean."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"とても 深い 海の 底に すんでいるため 長い 間 人に 見つからなかった。 暗い 深海でも よく 見える 目を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La queue de Serpang est en forme de poisson. Il l’utilise pour attirer sa proie qu’il avale en une fois grâce à sa bouche béante. Ce Pokémon nage en tortillant son corps comme un serpent."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Huntail tiene una cola en forma de pez, que usa para atraer a su presa. Una vez que la tiene cerca, la engulle sin más. Este Pokémon nada haciendo serpentear el cuerpo como si fuera un reptil."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Huntail’s tail is shaped like a fish. It uses the tail to attract prey, then swallows the prey whole with its large, gaping mouth. This Pokémon swims by wiggling its slender body like a snake."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"魚の 形をした シッポで おびき寄せ 大きな 口で エサを 丸のみ する。 ヘビのように 体を くねらせて 泳ぐ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ce piètre nageur se sert de sa queue pour appâter ses proies. Il les gobe si elles approchent de trop près."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Curiosamente, no es un gran nadador. Agita la cola para atraer a sus presas y, cuando estas se acercan, las engulle de golpe."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s not the strongest swimmer. It wags its tail to lure in its prey and then gulps them down as soon as they get close."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"泳ぐ力は あまり 強くない。 シッポを 振って 獲物を 呼び寄せ 近寄ったところを ガブリと いく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il habite dans les profondeurs de l’océan. Un Serpang trouvé sur la plage serait un mauvais présage."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Vive en los fondos marinos. Según una leyenda, que un Huntail aparezca varado en la playa es señal de mal augurio."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Deep seas are their habitat. According to tradition, when Huntail wash up onshore, something unfortunate will happen."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"深海に 生息。 ハンテールが 浜に 打ちあがると 不吉なことが 起こるという 言い伝えが ある。"}],"varieties":[{"id":367,"moves":[{"name":"bind","learns":[[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[13,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[5,"level-up",8],[6,"level-up",8],[7,"level-up",8],[8,"level-up",6],[9,"level-up",6],[10,"level-up",6],[11,"level-up",6],[12,"level-up",8],[13,"level-up",8],[14,"level-up",6],[15,"level-up",6],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"water-gun","learns":[[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"hydro-pump","learns":[[5,"level-up",50],[6,"level-up",50],[7,"level-up",50],[8,"level-up",51],[9,"level-up",51],[10,"level-up",51],[11,"level-up",51],[12,"level-up",50],[13,"level-up",50],[14,"level-up",51],[15,"level-up",50],[16,"level-up",50],[17,"level-up",50],[18,"level-up",50],[23,"level-up",50]]},{"name":"surf","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"machine",0],[13,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-beam","learns":[[5,"machine",0],[6,"machine",0],[7,"machine",0],[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[12,"mach